<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
   <meta charset="utf-8">
   <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
   <title>Your order is delivered</title>
   <style>
      * { font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) { .content-padding { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; } }
   </style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; background-color: #f6f7f9; color: #17202a;">
<div style="display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden;">Order {{ OrderCode }} is delivered - enjoy.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; background-color: #f6f7f9;">
   <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 12px;">
         <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius: 4px;">
            {% include 'header' %}
            <tr>
               <td class="content-padding" style="padding: 32px 32px 0 32px;">
                  <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e4f8f; letter-spacing: 1.4px; text-transform: uppercase;">Order delivered</div>
                  <h1 style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 600; color: #17202a;">Your order is delivered</h1>
                  <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #5f6b78;">{{ CourierFirstName }} delivered your order <strong style="color: #17202a;">{{ OrderCode }}</strong> at {{ DeliveredAt }}. Enjoy, {{ CustomerFirstName }}!</p>
               </td>
            </tr>
<tr><td class="content-padding" style="padding: 16px 32px 0 32px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #5f6b78;">From <strong style="color: #17202a;">{{ PartnerName }}, {{ PickupPointName }}</strong> to <strong style="color: #17202a;">{{ DeliveryAddress }}</strong>.</td></tr>
            {% include 'lines' %}
            <tr><td style="padding: 28px 0 0 0;"></td></tr>
            {% include 'footer' %}
         </table>
      </td>
   </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
